* XSETGGR 2005-05-10 nom3107 change length of noporo field
* XSETGGR 2006-03-08 changes #NOPORO to #NOPORO1
* xsetggr 2007-05-09 p(294774) change date/time format in lists
* xsetggr 2007-06-21 p(294790) restow due changes in dompom-parms
* xsetggr 2007-06-27 NOM3201   support P11 format run numbers
* xsetggr 2007-09-20 p(296832) add 'Created Date/Time' to printout list
* xsetggr 2007-11-30 NRT2771   Star/stop physical printers
* XSETHZ  2007-12-11 NRT2769   Browse command in printout
* xsetggr 2008-03-06 add option to protect browsing bundles
* xsetggr 2008-03-11 p(302778) change format of RBINSZ-N parms
* xsetggr 2008-05-05 p(304350) get size of binary docs from spool attr.
* xsetggr 2008-07-09 p(292935) not display printed time if error
* XSETHZ  2008-07-23 p(307577) use full name of ES-APP-SERVER-LIBRARY
* fhi     2008-07-24 P307319   restow due to changes in DDM NRM-BUNDLE-CONTENTS
* fhi     2009-11-11 P321483   New Status 'X' wait for external ok      ONTENTS
* xsetggr 2010-03-08 P321493   corrrection for P319147 - operator can
*                    browse reports from own folders and linked folders,
*                    if linked folder is granted
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
* xsetggr 2010-08-26 NOMALL-870 use NOSRCK-N for source existance check
* fhi     2011-05-02 NOMALL-901 Log any online delete operation
* fhi     2011-09-14 NOMALL-901 Add printer name to logging
* xsetggr 2011-09-28 NOMALL-901 correct writing delete operations in log
* xsetggr 2012-01-12 NOMALL-1020 write language independant msgs to log
* xsetggr 2012-03-11 NOMALL-1099 use interface to call RLOG from NGC
* SU1     2014-11-17 NOMALL-1450 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* fhi     2015-05-18 NOMALL-1552 Show real size, not base64 size
* SU2     2015-06-01 NOMALL-1552 Show size 1 (instead 0)
* SU3     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* fhi     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1465 Correct granting for browse
* CF1     2016-01-25 NOMALL-1465 Correct option setting
